    {
      "id": "claim_342cf017a38549fc92bb2c7b20fc9fd5",
      "statement": "An omitted resourceUrlPatterns (all resource types) is distinct from an empty array (none): observabilityScopesForResources returns workers-observability.read for undefined or non-empty patterns but no scopes for [], so a billing-only connection cannot silently acquire telemetry access — the same contract documented on GatekeeperConnectOptions.",
      "evidence": [
