    {
      "id": "claim_4e13777a452e4ca19cee27b34865c858",
      "statement": "Two observability resource granularities (whole account via /workers-and-pages/observability, or one Worker via /services/view/:workerName/production/observability) both map to the single indivisible workers-observability.read OAuth scope; the binding, not the grant, is the finer capability boundary, and grantedResourceUrlPatterns is derived from the granted scopes with ensureResources expanding the grant only when a requested pattern is missing.",
