    {
      "id": "claim_5a617892bd7a4e40aa9bdcdff93384e5",
      "statement": "calculate() is the one observability read with no second line of defence — an aggregate cannot be un-mixed — so it rests solely on the injected filter, an accepted and documented gap with the group-by fix left as a follow-up; trace summaries are account-only because their shape describes the whole cross-service trace, though a Worker binding can still fetch its own events for a known trace id.",
