    {
      "id": "claim_99cbec299fd6411397e1ce71151f1562",
      "statement": "Sharing a gadget with an observability binding is admission-gated on the collaborator's OWN connected Cloudflare account (addObserver checks their credentials, not the owner's), and deniesAccess classifies only 400/401/403/404 as credential-lacks-access — a 5xx or transport error must never be reported as a denial, since that would be a silent authorization decision either way.",
